category: Libs
build-depends: cygport 
sdesc: "Logger optimized for games (licensing & readmes)"
ldesc: "Logog is a portable C++ library to facilitate logging of real-time events in
performance-oriented applications, such as games. It is especially appropriate
for projects that have constrained memory and constrained CPU requirements."
skip:

homepage: https://github.com/johnwbyrd/logog
license: MIT
